  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given that&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;is a unit vector.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>|</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>We know that<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>,</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>|</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>|</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>|</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>|</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>|</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>|</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>|</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>|</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>|</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8739;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced><mn>64</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>|</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mfenced><mn>8</mn></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mo>|</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"\"><mrow><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>|</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>|</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>|</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>|</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo